{"film": "<div aria-label=\"TalkVela in action\" class=\"tv-film\" data-film=\"\">\n<div class=\"tv-film__scene tv-app is-on is-ask\" data-scene=\"app\">\n<div class=\"tv-app__q\"><span class=\"tv-app__lab\">AI conversation preview · English B1 · Interview practice</span><p class=\"tv-app__qt\"><span data-typed=\"\">How long have you studied design?</span><i class=\"tv-film__cur\"></i></p></div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__a\"><span class=\"tv-app__lab\">Your sentence</span><p class=\"tv-film__ans\"><span class=\"tv-film__w\">I’ve</span> <span class=\"tv-film__w\" data-w=\"pron\">studied</span> <span class=\"tv-film__w\" data-w=\"vocab\">design</span> <span class=\"tv-film__w\" data-w=\"gram\"><s>since</s><mark>for</mark></span> <span class=\"tv-film__w\">two</span> <span class=\"tv-film__w\">years.</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__card\">\n<div class=\"tv-app__pane\" data-pane=\"check\"><div class=\"tv-app__ct\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12.2l2.7 2.7L16 9.6\"></path></svg><span>Checking your answer</span></div><div class=\"tv-film__checks\"><div class=\"tv-film__chk\" data-c=\"pron\"><b>Pronunciation</b><span>Clear</span></div><div class=\"tv-film__chk\" data-c=\"vocab\"><b>Vocabulary</b><span>Good word</span></div><div class=\"tv-film__chk\" data-c=\"flu\"><b>Fluency</b><span>No pauses</span></div><div class=\"tv-film__chk\" data-c=\"gram\"><b>Grammar</b><span>1 fix</span></div></div><p class=\"tv-app__hint tv-app__hint--chk\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5 1 1.2 1 2.1h5c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.1A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z\"></path></svg><span>Vela listens to your whole answer, then picks the one thing worth fixing.</span></p></div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__pane\" data-pane=\"fix\"><div class=\"tv-app__ct\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12.2l2.7 2.7L16 9.6\"></path></svg><span>One small correction</span></div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__swap\"><s>since</s><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg><b>for</b></div>\n<p class=\"tv-app__why\">Use <b>for</b> with a length of time, like two years. Use <b>since</b> with a starting point, like 2024.</p>\n<p class=\"tv-app__hint\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5 1 1.2 1 2.1h5c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.1A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z\"></path></svg><span>For two years · A length of time</span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__foot\"><span class=\"tv-app__mic\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"11\" rx=\"3\" width=\"6\" x=\"9\" y=\"3\"></rect><path d=\"M5.5 11a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0M12 17.5V21\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"tv-app__status\" data-status=\"\">Vela is asking…</span>\n<span class=\"tv-demo__bars tv-app__bars\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"tv-app__btn\">Try again<svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tv-film__scene tv-app tv-done\" data-scene=\"doc\">\n<div class=\"tv-app__a tv-done__in\"><span class=\"tv-app__lab\">Your conversation recap</span><p class=\"tv-film__ans\">I’ve studied design <b class=\"tv-done__fix\">for</b> two years.</p></div>\n<div class=\"tv-app__card tv-done__card tv-done__in\"><div class=\"tv-app__pane\">\n<div class=\"tv-app__ct\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12.2l2.7 2.7L16 9.6\"></path></svg><span>Ready to try it again</span></div>\n<div class=\"tv-done__row\"><span class=\"tv-done__sk\"><i><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 12.5l4 4L18 8\"></path></svg></i>Pronunciation<em></em></span><span class=\"tv-done__sk\"><i><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 12.5l4 4L18 8\"></path></svg></i>Vocabulary<em></em></span><span class=\"tv-done__sk\"><i><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 12.5l4 4L18 8\"></path></svg></i>Fluency<em></em></span><span class=\"tv-done_