></span></div><span class=\"tv-p__count\"><em data-lang=\"\">English</em> <b data-count=\"\">1 / 7</b></span></div>\n<div class=\"tv-p__vela\"><span class=\"tv-p__ic is-white\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 10v4M8 7v10M12 4v16M16 8v8M20 10.5v3\"></path></svg></span><span data-vela=\"\">What are you studying?</span></div>\n<div class=\"tv-p__me\"><span class=\"tv-p__av\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"3.6\"></circle><path d=\"M5 20c.8-3.6 3.6-5.6 7-5.6s6.2 2 7 5.6\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"tv-p__mebub\"><span data-me=\"\">I’m studying design, and I’d love to work abroad.</span><span class=\"tv-p__meic\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 10v4M8 7v10M12 4v16M16 8v8M20 10.5v3\"></path></svg></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tv-p__stage\"><div class=\"tv-p__micwrap is-live\"><span class=\"tv-p__halo\"></span><span class=\"tv-p__listen\"><span class=\"tv-p__bars\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></span></div>\n<span class=\"tv-p__cap\">Listening…</span></div>\n</div></div>", "row-pron": "<div class=\"tvx\" data-k=\"row-pron\"><div class=\"tvx__stage\" data-h=\"960\" data-w=\"1474\"><div class=\"bgl\" style=\"background-image:url(/assets/hero-v2/runtime/v1-components/bg/bg-light.webp);\"></div>\n<div class=\"bubble\"><svg class=\"wv\" viewbox=\"0 0 52 52\"><g fill=\"#111\"><rect height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"0\" y=\"19.0\"></rect><rect height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"9\" y=\"13.0\"></rect><rect height=\"40\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"18\" y=\"6.0\"></rect><rect height=\"52\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"27\" y=\"0.0\"></rect><rect height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"36\" y=\"9.0\"></rect><rect height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"45\" y=\"16.0\"></rect></g></svg><p>I <span class=\"hl\"><s>sink</s></span> it’s a good idea.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><p class=\"lab\">Pronunciation · English · /θ/</p><p>I <u>think</u> it’s a good idea. For “th”, let the air pass gently over your tongue.</p></d