></div></div></div>", "row-fluency": "<div class=\"tvx\" data-k=\"row-fluency\"><div class=\"tvx__stage\" data-h=\"960\" data-w=\"1474\"><div class=\"bgl\" style=\"background-image:url(/assets/hero-v2/runtime/v1-components/bg/bg-light.webp);transform:scaleX(-1);\"></div>\n<div class=\"bubble\"><svg class=\"wv\" viewbox=\"0 0 52 52\"><g fill=\"#111\"><rect height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"0\" y=\"19.0\"></rect><rect height=\"26\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"9\" y=\"13.0\"></rect><rect height=\"40\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"18\" y=\"6.0\"></rect><rect height=\"52\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"27\" y=\"0.0\"></rect><rect height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"36\" y=\"9.0\"></rect><rect height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" width=\"4\" x=\"45\" y=\"16.0\"></rect></g></svg><p>I think<span class=\"hl\"><s>, um,</s></span> we should<span class=\"hl\"><s>, like,</s></span> try a different idea.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><p class=\"lab\">Fluency practice · English</p><p>Fewer fillers, longer answers. You spoke for 4 minutes without stopping.</p></div></div></div>", "grid-topics": "<div class=\"tvx\" data-k=\"grid-topics\"><div class=\"tvx__stage\" data-h=\"800\" data-w=\"1240\"><img class=\"bg\" src=\"/assets/hero-v2/runtime/v1-components/bg/bg-daisies.webp\"/><div class=\"glass today\">\n<div class=\"pick\"><svg style=\"fill:#7dd3b5;stroke:none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.4 7.6L22 12l-7.6 2.4L12 22l-2.4-7.6L2 12l7.6-2.4z\"></path></svg>Picked for you · English · B1</div>\n<h3>Small talk about this weekend’s match</h3>\n<div class=\"ask\"><span class=\"av\"><svg style=\"stroke:none\" viewbox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect fill=\"#1b1b1b\" height=\"64\" rx=\"15\" width=\"64\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1.6\" width=\"3.2\" x=\"14\" y=\"27.0\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1.6\" width=\"3.2\" x=\"20\" y=\"23.0\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"26\" rx=\"1.6\" width=\"3.2\" x=\"26\" y=\"19.0\"></rect><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"32\" rx=\"1.6\" w