 class=\"dot on\"></i><i class=\"dot on\"></i><i class=\"dot on\"></i><i class=\"dot\"></i><i class=\"dot\"></i><span class=\"t\">Back in 2 days</span></div>\n</div></div></div>", "grid-phrases": "<div class=\"tvx\" data-k=\"grid-phrases\"><div class=\"tvx__stage\" data-h=\"800\" data-w=\"1240\"><div class=\"bgl\" style=\"background-image:url(/assets/hero-v2/runtime/v1-components/bg/bg-light.webp)\"></div><div class=\"glass chat\">\n<div class=\"role\"><span class=\"lab\">Role-play · Meeting your new roommate</span><em>English · B1</em></div>\n<div class=\"m\"><span class=\"av\">L</span><span class=\"b\">How are you finding your first week here?</span></div>\n<div class=\"m me\"><span class=\"b\"><span class=\"wv\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>It’s been great. I’m still finding my way around.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"tip\"><div class=\"h\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12.2l2.7 2.7L16 9.6\"></path></svg>Sounds natural. Also try:</div><div class=\"alts\"><span>Could you show me around?</span><span>Where do you usually study?</span></div></div>\n</div></div></div>"}